                THE PC-RISC SYSTEM PC4000 BOARD FEATURES:

      * Multiple PC4000s (up to six) can plug into the PC.
      * Use PC as I/O server -- load/store programs and data from PC,
        no on board PROM, PC4000 has direct memory access to PC disks,
        I/O, or memory-to-memory transfers.
      * Read/write to any PC memory location.  Move data from any
        PC4000 coprocessor to any other.
      * PC4000 shares bus and a minimum of 16K bytes of memory
        with the PC for communications and data transport.
      * PCX concurrent multi-PC4000 board software includes
        development system and a fast full-featured screen editor.
      * Direct PCX-editor/PC4000 switching for convenient fast
        software development turnaround with 512k RAM disk.
      * 512K bytes on-board 256Kx18 bit, parity checked DRAM.
      * PC4000 memory can be used for expanding PC memory
